  "description": "Reports Red Hat Developer Hub plugin catalog index status for a release branch or x.y.z and updates the downstream quay.io/rhdh/plugin-catalog-index after you approve the push. Reads the upstream Plugin-Catalog-Status wiki and midstream docs/catalog-status.md, classifies missing Quay tags into Konflux respins versus sync-midstream calls to action, and waits on rhdh-tenant PipelineRuns with oc. Use for \"catalog index status\", \"plugin catalog index is failing\", \"missing plugin builds\", \"outdated workspaces\", \"update the downstream catalog index\", \"quay.io/rhdh/plugin-catalog-index\", \"checkPluginsExist\", or \"Konflux plugin PipelineRuns\".",
